    "updated_at": "2021-11-23T15:39:23Z",
    "body": "The number of active jobs is passed to starship as a command line argument. To show jobs in the  `explain` output, you can use the `--jobs` flag:\r\n```sh\r\nstarship explain --jobs 3\r\n```\r\n\r\nI don't think it's feasible for starship to get the number of jobs by itself, but it might be possible to work around this with a new environment variable.",
