    "updated_at": "2022-08-29T20:46:29Z",
    "body": "I had exactly the same problem as @Sayanel01 - I was annoyed about that star - didn't know what it meant and how to get rid of it.\r\n\r\nLuckily I found it doing a ctrl+f search of the module docs. See #4324 - now it should be indexed by Google and easier to find for everyone in the future :) \r\n\r\nIf you use nerd font, it's actually not a `+` sign but a `✦`.",
